{"answerArea":{"calculator":true,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"The limit expression has the following form:\n\n$\\displaystyle\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\dfrac{f(t+h)-f(t)}{h}$\n\nTherefore, it describes a derivative of a certain function $f$ at a certain $x$-value $t$. Can you recognize what $f$ and $t$ are?","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Since the numerator is $3\\arccos\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}+h\\right)-3\\arccos\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)$, we can tell that the function is $f(x)=3\\arccos(x)$ and the $x$-value is $\\dfrac{1}{2}$.\n\nIn other words, the limit expression is equal to $f'\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)$ for $f(x)=3\\arccos(x)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's find $f'(x)$:\n\n$f'(x)=3\\cdot \\dfrac{-1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$\n\nNow let's evaluate $f'\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)$:\n\n$\\begin{align}f'\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)\u0026=3\\cdot \\dfrac{-1}{\\sqrt{1-\\left(\\dfrac12\\right)^2}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{-3}{\\sqrt{\\dfrac{3}{4}}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{-3}{\\left(\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{-6}{\\sqrt{3}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-2\\sqrt{3}\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, $\\displaystyle\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\dfrac{3\\arccos\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}+h\\right)-3\\arccos\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)}{h}=-2\\sqrt{3}$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Find $\\displaystyle\\lim_{h\\to 0}\\dfrac{3\\arccos\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}+h\\right)-3\\arccos\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)}{h}$.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]\n\n","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$-\\dfrac{2\\sqrt{3}}{3}$","correct":false},{"content":"$-2\\sqrt{3}$","correct":true},{"content":"$\\sqrt{3}$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"The limit doesn't exist","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
